      "writtenOn": "2026-06-20T00:22:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree it\u0027s imperfect.  I considered this quite a bit, and right now I\u0027m worried that we\u0027ll end up with a huge number of repetitive warnings.  At least right now we still get a signal that something is wrong.\n\nPerhaps we should let this bake for a bit, and if the fear of too many warnings is overblown, then either remove the warning cap or make it per-playbook.",
